<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:13:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>根据一项新的研究，单身美国人希望潜在伴侣的收入至少为六位数。千禧一代将“理想”门槛定为 16 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/single-americans-partner-earnings-ideal-study-millennials/</link><description>人们说爱情无法定价，但在当今的经济形势下，这可能是常识。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2274466190-e1788345763300.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 11:00:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/single-americans-partner-earnings-ideal-study-millennials/</guid></item><item><title>在中东遇难的飞行员遗孀被告知危险津贴和与战斗相关的税收减免不适用，因为“我们没有处于战争状态”。病毒帖子修复了它</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/widow-airman-alex-klinner-killed-iran-war-hazard-pay-combat-related-tax-breaks/</link><description>副总统万斯拒绝使用“战争”一词来形容美国在伊朗的战斗，称“没有发生枪击事件”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26247731142106-e1788615497633.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:47:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/widow-airman-alex-klinner-killed-iran-war-hazard-pay-combat-related-tax-breaks/</guid></item><item><title>美国网球明星杰西卡·佩古拉 (Jessica Pegula) 的父亲也在体育领域投入巨资——他拥有 NFL 的布法罗比尔队 (Buffalo Bills)，净资产达 93 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/tennis-star-jessica-pegula-chasing-history-us-open-billionaire-family-oil-tycoon-terry-pegula-buffalo-bills-owner-hard-work-success/</link><description>杰西卡·佩古拉正在追逐网球排名第一和她的第一个大满贯冠军，同时建立自己来自亿万富翁家庭的遗产。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293198740-e1788462790960.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/tennis-star-jessica-pegula-chasing-history-us-open-billionaire-family-oil-tycoon-terry-pegula-buffalo-bills-owner-hard-work-success/</guid></item><item><title>求职者正在等待“九月高峰”。经济学家表示，炒作背后有一些东西，并解释了为什么现在是申请的好时机</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/september-surge-hiring-jobs-linkedin-indeed/</link><description>九月份的招聘炒作背后确实存在季节性模式，但更多的职位发布并不一定意味着更快的招聘。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2193912865-e1788541156185.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/september-surge-hiring-jobs-linkedin-indeed/</guid></item><item><title>科技公司首席执行官希望世界拥抱人工智能，但 G20 集会外的抗议者表明该行业日益普及的问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/tech-ceos-ai-data-centers-g20-protests-sam-altman-nvidia-jensen-huang-palantir-alex-karp-chapel-hill-north-carolina-ai-backlash/</link><description>当科技公司首席执行官在北卡罗来纳州教堂山举行的 G20 峰会上支持人工智能时，数百人聚集在外面抗议数据中心和其他问题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292627030-e1788569475853.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/tech-ceos-ai-data-centers-g20-protests-sam-altman-nvidia-jensen-huang-palantir-alex-karp-chapel-hill-north-carolina-ai-backlash/</guid></item><item><title>随着美国柴油价格创历史新高，被忽视的俄罗斯-乌克兰战争对能源的影响越来越大</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/overlooked-russia-ukraine-war-outsized-impact-energy-diesel-high/</link><description>乌克兰对俄罗斯炼油厂的攻击日益成功，正在波及全球汽油和柴油能源市场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292918001-e1788550561358.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 07:09:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/overlooked-russia-ukraine-war-outsized-impact-energy-diesel-high/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 悄然提升了 Astra 的一些评估指标，并在发布后继续改变其他指标</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/openai-quietly-boosts-some-of-astras-evaluation-metrics-amid-rare-delay-in-publication-of-the-modeblog-post-announcement/</link><description>OpenAI 博客上有关 Astra 的数字不断变化。在某些情况下，这些变化使 Astra 看起来更好，而竞争对手的车型看起来更糟。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292640403-e1788541880552.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:12:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/openai-quietly-boosts-some-of-astras-evaluation-metrics-amid-rare-delay-in-publication-of-the-modeblog-post-announcement/</guid></item><item><title>比特币的交易再次更像是“黄金的放大版”，但四年周期理论可能会进一步下跌</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/bitcoin-amplified-gold-four-year-cycle-theory-price-rally-safe-haven-dollar-bond-market-volatility-downside-risk/</link><description>一些分析师警告称，今年晚些时候完成的四年周期可能会带来另一次下滑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291864174-e1788552788603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:29:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/bitcoin-amplified-gold-four-year-cycle-theory-price-rally-safe-haven-dollar-bond-market-volatility-downside-risk/</guid></item><item><title>丹麦和四个欧盟国家就欧盟外移民“返回中心”达成一致，计划于 2027 年启动</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/five-eu-countries-migrant-return-hub-human-rights/</link><description>荷兰庇护和移民部长巴特·范登布林克（Bart van den Brink）表示：“这是新事物，具有开创性。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2223740340-e1788552747656.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:22:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/five-eu-countries-migrant-return-hub-human-rights/</guid></item><item><title>“喂养野兽”：Meta 在新诉讼中面临使用其“变态眼镜”训练人工智能的指控</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/meta-perv-glasses-ai-lawsuit/</link><description>在同意达成同类最大的儿童安全和解协议几周后，这家科技巨头面临新的隐私诉讼。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2235451108-e1788549079700.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 19:28:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/meta-perv-glasses-ai-lawsuit/</guid></item></channel></rss>